1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:02,697
A puff of smoke rose from a machine.

2
00:00:02,647 --> 00:00:05,159
The wind began to blow it away.

3
00:00:05,159 --> 00:00:11,261
We compared petrol and gasoline and learned that they name the same fuel; gas can also mean a gaseous fuel.

4
00:00:11,261 --> 00:00:13,795
We chose an electric tool instead.

5
00:00:13,795 --> 00:00:18,079
After intensive work, the surrounding area was in better condition.

6
00:00:18,079 --> 00:00:22,999
The situation improved, but dense clouds made us watch the storm’s intensity.

7
00:00:23,000 --> 00:00:26,784
We saw a warning light flash and a worker emerge from the shed.

8
00:00:26,784 --> 00:00:31,193
Near deep water, life jackets could help people float rather than drown.

9
00:00:31,193 --> 00:00:33,488
Safety came before speed.

